        "title": "Enhanced Pilates Cable System — Studio-Grade Movement",
        "text_1": "The defining feature of the RS03 PRO. Engineered with premium-grade materials and a redesigned routing architecture, these cables deliver smoother transitions between exercises, greater range of motion through every movement pattern, and a tactile responsiveness that serious Pilates practitioners will immediately appreciate.",
