        "title": "500W Servo Motor — Digital Precision",
        "text_1": "The RS03 PRO is powered by a 500W servo motor — the most refined motor system in the Sensol lineup. This 500W output delivers instantaneous response, consistent tension through the entire range of motion, and the ability to handle explosive movements without lag.",
        "text_2": "Whether you are performing slow, controlled Pilates work or high-tempo strength circuits, the motors maintain perfect resistance throughout. The Your Reformer ($2,795 AUD) has no motors at all — it is entirely spring-based. The RS03 PRO delivers motorised precision at a fraction of the cost of any motorised competitor."
      }
