        "title": "Widest Arm Range: 0–145°, Eight Positions",
        "text_1": "The RS03 PRO features the widest arm adjustment range in the Sensol lineup: 0–145° across eight precisely engineered positions. This expansive arc, combined with the enhanced cables, creates a movement surface that accommodates everything from narrow-grip footwork to wide rotational pulls.",
        "text_2": "Every angle is locked in with a quick-release mechanism that ensures stability under load. Traditional reformers have no adjustable arms whatsoever. Even within the smart reformer category, the RS03 PRO's 145° range exceeds what most competitors offer."
      }
