        "title": "Studio costs add up. The RS03 PRO pays for itself.",
        "text": "At $2,800 AUD, the RS03 PRO is an investment that pays for itself remarkably quickly. Compared to a $220/month unlimited studio membership, the break-even is approximately 13 months. Over five years, the RS03 PRO delivers savings of $10,400–$16,400 compared to studio memberships — while providing both Pilates and strength training, AI-driven coaching, and the convenience of home."
